    "A multidão rugiu novamente, e as portas se abriram."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:610
translate ptPT qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_SpecialFightBloodworks_f42992e4:

